{"candidates":[],"candidates_truncated":false,"canonical_status":"canonical","citations":[],"contract_version":"2","descriptions":[{"evidence_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42:a26a3829dd42155848392c0636daebd6ca01acf540d3509fec2ac3219f8596c5:line:109289","original":"An ongoing 2017-to-present [[4koma]] manga series written and illustrated by [[Hamazi Aki]]. Received an anime adaptation by [[Cloverworks]] in Fall 2022. Season 2 has been announced.\r\n\r\nThe story involves [[Gotoh Hitori]] (aka Bocchi), a shy guitarist who reluctantly plays with the [[Kessoku Band]] to overcome her social anxiety.\r\n\r\nh4. Characters\r\n\r\nh6. Main characters\r\n\r\n* [[Gotoh Hitori]]\r\n* [[Yamada Ryo]]\r\n* [[Kita Ikuyo]]\r\n* [[Ijichi Nijika]]\r\n\r\nh6. Other characters\r\n\r\n* [[Hiroi Kikuri]]\r\n* [[Gotoh Futari]]\r\n* [[Gotoh Naoki]]\r\n* [[Gotoh Michiyo]]\r\n* [[Ijichi Seika]]\r\n* [[Jimihen]]\r\n* [[Kamimura (Bocchi the Rock!)|]]\r\n* [[Pa-san]]\r\n* [[Iwashita Shima]]\r\n* [[Shimizu Eliza]]\r\n* [[Ohtsuki Yoyoko]]\r\n* [[Sato Aiko]]\r\n* [[Kessoku band fan 1]]\r\n* [[Kessoku band fan 2]]\r\n* [[Uchida Yuyu]]\r\n\r\nh4. External links\r\n\r\n* \"Official Site\":https://bocchi.rocks/\r\n* \"Wikipedia: Bocchi the Rock!\":[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!]\r\n* \"Wikipedia (JP): ぼっち・ざ・ろっく!\":[https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/ぼっち・ざ・ろっく!]","response_truncated":false,"search_text_truncated":false,"source_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42","status":"source_backed","title":"bocchi_the_rock!"}],"evidence_chain":[{"evidence_id":"native:1587881","fetched_at_utc":"2026-09-30T06:43:34.899059+00:00","raw_path":"reports/P3/raw/4ccce02e466f4f14ee4a5252b48b72c33b53db57c6b470fe7307e40a3668a7b8.raw","raw_sha256":"4ccce02e466f4f14ee4a5252b48b72c33b53db57c6b470fe7307e40a3668a7b8","role":"native_identity","source_id":"danbooru-native-scoped-4ccce02e466f","tag_id":1587881},{"active_alias_ids":[],"coverage":"scoped_complete","evidence_id":"scope:bocchi_the_rock!","fetched_at_utc":